ics just renamed but  she calls him mark and he says why did  you call me mark this is because he is  no longer in the mark specter identity  so he has no idea what happened as mark  he is actually stephen grant in this  scene and steven grant is one identity  of mark who is actually very rich and is  a wall street player he's a millionaire  who is extremely well dressed and goes  to fundraisers and galas much like bruce  wayne he then has the jake lockley  identity jake is a cab driver who goes  around gathering intel and he's pretty  brutal he's got eyes and ears everywhere  and he's very dark very rude and he kind  of just beats people up so we have mark  spector jake lockley steven grant who i  believe they're kind of combining into  one character here because we can see  that steven is kind of rough around the  edges it looks like he is somewhat of a  cab driver in this trailer perhaps  steven is just going to be one  personality of jake and steven and we  can see him turn into this rough guy  perhaps into a millionaire in the show  so mark spector the mercenary the xcia  member with a character that is somewhat  the combination of stephen grant and  jake lockley then of course we have moon  knight but then we have konshu now as it  turns out in the comics konshu isn't  exactly the moon god he's actually what  is called an elder god and he's actually  banished from the earth realm but he  uses mark spector to do his bidding as  moon knight so when mark spector takes  on the personality of konchu he's either  an alternate personality or he's the  actual real elder god living inside of  mark's mind and he communicates with him  psychically and sometimes he gives him  advice like a parent would but sometimes  he actually uses mark to do his own  bidding as a bloodthirsty and vengeful  elder god and this is actually who we  see here in this hallway scene walking  towards mark or i should say stephen in  the scene where he's absolutely  terrified and doesn't know if